WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
You saw the first target.
What happened to the second?

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
In the attentional blink, two quick targets
can compete for what we report.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
In 1992, researchers measured
a narrow window of missed probes.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Later intensive meditation research
found changes in a laboratory task.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
But that is not a trial
of a particular commercial MP3 program.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Explore the evidence, try a free routine,
then choose what matters to you.
